---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
const posts = (await getCollection('blog', ({data}) => !data.draft)).sort((a,b)=>b.data.pubDate.valueOf()-a.data.pubDate.valueOf());
const categories = [...new Set(posts.map(p=>p.data.category))];
---
<Base><section class="hero wrap"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> NOTES FROM THE WORKBENCH</div><h1>少一点概念，<br/>多一点<span>动手实践。</span></h1><p>工具、技术、效率与日常实践。<br/>记录具体问题，也留下可以复用的方法。</p><a class="hero-link" href="#articles">浏览实践笔记 <span>↓</span></a><div class="hero-mark" aria-hidden="true"><span>{'{'}<br/>&nbsp; build<br/>&nbsp; learn<br/>&nbsp; share<br/>{'}'}</span><i>WORK IN PROGRESS / ALWAYS</i></div></section><section class="articles wrap" id="articles"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">THE NOTEBOOK</div><h2>实践笔记 <sup>{String(posts.length).padStart(2,'0')}</sup></h2></div><label class="search"><span>⌕</span><input type="search" id="search" placeholder="搜索标题、内容或标签" aria-label="搜索文章"/></label></div><div class="filters" aria-label="文章分类"><button class="active" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">全部文章</button>{categories.map(c=><button data-filter={c} aria-pressed="false">{c}</button>)}</div><div class="post-list">{posts.map((p,i)=><a class="post" href={`/posts/${p.id}/`} data-category={p.data.category} data-search={`${p.data.title} ${p.data.description} ${p.data.tags.join(' ')} ${p.body}`}><span class="post-number">{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><div><div class="post-meta"><span>{p.data.category}</span><time datetime={p.data.pubDate.toISOString()}>{p.data.pubDate.toLocaleDateString('zh-CN',{timeZone:'Asia/Shanghai'})}</time></div><h3>{p.data.title}</h3><p>{p.data.description}</p><div class="tags">{p.data.tags.map(t=><span>#{t}</span>)}</div></div><span class="post-arrow">↗</span></a>)}</div><p id="empty" hidden>没有找到相关文章，试试其他关键词。</p></section><section class="note wrap"><span>⌘</span><div><h2>先验证，再记录。</h2><p>清楚标注适用条件、操作步骤与内容边界。工具会变，解决问题的方法值得留下。</p></div><a href="/about/">关于这个站点 ↗</a></section></Base>
<script>
let category='all';const input=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#search')!;function filter(){const q=input.value.trim().toLowerCase();let count=0;document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.post').forEach(p=>{const show=(category==='all'||p.dataset.category===category)&&p.dataset.search!.toLowerCase().includes(q);p.hidden=!show;if(show)count++;});document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#empty')!.hidden=count>0;}input.addEventListener('input',filter);document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-filter]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{category=b.dataset.filter!;document.querySelectorAll('[data-filter]').forEach(x=>{x.classList.toggle('active',x===b);x.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(x===b));});filter();}));
</script>
